{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1765","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"J. Hero to Zero"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are no heroes in this problem. I guess we should have named it \"To Zero\"."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two arrays $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$, each of these arrays contains $$$n$$$ non-negative integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$c$$$ be a matrix of size $$$n \\times n$$$ such that $$$c_{i,j} = |a_i - b_j|$$$ for every $$$i \\in [1, n]$$$ and every $$$j \\in [1, n]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to transform the matrix $$$c$$$ so that it becomes the zero matrix, i. e. a matrix where "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"every"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" element is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$0$$$. In order to do so, you may perform the following operations any number of times, in any order:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose an integer $$$i$$$, then decrease $$$c_{i,j}$$$ by $$$1$$$ for every $$$j \\in [1, n]$$$ (i. e. decrease all elements in the $$$i$$$-th row by $$$1$$$). In order to perform this operation, you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pay"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose an integer $$$j$$$, then decrease $$$c_{i,j}$$$ by $$$1$$$ for every $$$i \\in [1, n]$$$ (i. e. decrease all elements in the $$$j$$$-th column by $$$1$$$). In order to perform this operation, you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pay"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose two integers $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$, then decrease $$$c_{i,j}$$$ by $$$1$$$. In order to perform this operation, you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pay"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose an integer $$$i$$$, then increase $$$c_{i,j}$$$ by $$$1$$$ for every $$$j \\in [1, n]$$$ (i. e. increase all elements in the $$$i$$$-th row by $$$1$$$). When you perform this operation, you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"receive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ coin; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose an integer $$$j$$$, then increase $$$c_{i,j}$$$ by $$$1$$$ for every $$$i \\in [1, n]$$$ (i. e. increase all elements in the $$$j$$$-th column by $$$1$$$). When you perform this operation, you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"receive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ coin. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to calculate the minimum number of coins required to transform the matrix $$$c$$$ into the zero matrix. Note that all elements of $$$c$$$ should be equal to $$$0$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simultaneously"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" after the operations."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"childr